  "body": "Title and CCC issued. Move in today.\r\n\r\nTHE MOVE:\r\nA smart buy beats a stretched one.\r\n\r\nThis is where young families make the right move early. Brand new, sun filled, and designed to remove pressure rather than add it. Clean lines. Logical flow. A home that feels calm, safe, and easy to live in from day one.\r\n\r\nBuilt new and backed by a 10 Year Master Build Warranty, this 176.4 m² (more or less) freehold home protects your time, your money, and your peace of mind so your energy stays where it belongs. With family.\r\n\r\nThis isn't about pushing limits.\r\nIt's about buying with confidence.\r\n\r\nTHE REALPLAY:\r\nReal space. Real flexibility. Real value.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms. Three bathrooms. Two genuine master ensuites plus a guest WC so mornings run smoothly, guests settle in comfortably, and privacy stays intact. Open plan kitchen and living connect seamlessly to a sunny balcony, creating a natural hub where daily life feels easy and unforced.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, a private ensuite with its own deck and yard invites rare flexibility. Ideal for grandparents, teenagers, long stay guests, or future Airbnb income if and when it suits you. A home that adjusts as your family grows rather than boxing you in.\r\n\r\nFreehold ownership. Internal access garage plus two additional parking spaces deliver everyday peace of mind.\r\n\r\nBrand new, low maintenance construction keeps ownership predictable. Fewer surprises. High usability. No over engineering. Real value without compromise.\r\n\r\nZoned for Macleans Primary School, Howick Intermediate, and Pakuranga College. A school pathway families actively compete for and rarely secure at this level.\r\n\r\nWalk to bus stops, groceries, cafés, library, medical centre, and daily essentials. Minutes to Highland Park Shopping Centre, Pak'nSave, Woolworths, Aviemore shops, and local dining.\r\n\r\nParks, sports facilities, and community spaces are close by. Pakuranga Highway and the Eastern Busway keep commutes efficient and school runs under control.\r\n\r\nHomes that align freehold title, real floor area, school zones, and value do not linger.\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for a future ready home where the numbers make sense and the lifestyle holds up, this is the moment.\r\n\r\nCall now and secure it before another family does.\r\nAll agents welcome.\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment.",
